{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたん卒業おめでとう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月だし、卒業というか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しい何かに挑戦するにはぴったりの時期でしたね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/04/07/0112933/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同い年って知った時はぶっちゃけマジかって思ったよ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それだけ大人っぽくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで出会った女の子の中で1番と言っていい程の衝撃でした笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんと話してて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の事気づかせてくれたし、友達や仲間の為にって思いが常にある人だったなって思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブで見たせいたんのパフォーマンスは今でも鮮明に覚えています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"月の大きさのソロでダンスを魅せる所で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのちっこいのは誰だっ⁈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思ってみたらせいたんで。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんってあんな風に踊る人だったっけ⁈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分よりも大きく動きを魅せる人なんだって眼を奪われたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな貴女だから、どこに行っても大丈夫よ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時々顔見せに来てね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"95年組がまた巣立ちました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか来る自分の巣立ちの日まで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は全力で頑張ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/04/07/0112933/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう。"}],"source":"archive"}